   # cutscene strings...
   # a '|' character forces the message to always appear
   "COG_50148"	   0  "Blast him!"
   "COG_50166"	   0  "There he is. Stop him!"
   "COG_71101"	   0  "Excellent, Mara."
   "COG_71102"	   0  "You are becoming very adept at using the Force to anticipate my actions."
   "COG_71103"	   0  "Someday that insight may save your life."
   "COG_71104"	   0  "Ah, what's going on?!"
   "COG_71105"	   0  "Captain Katarn, report to Ops immediately!  Captain Katarn, report to Ops immediately!"
   "COG_71106"	   0  "Commander, what's the situation?"
   "COG_71107"	   0  "We detected two asteroids approaching our atmosphere, and thought they'd break up on contact."
   "COG_71108"	   0  "We became alarmed when they took up a geo-synchronous orbit and began bombarding our shields."
   "COG_71109"	   0  "They appear to be some sort of new Imperial weapons disguised as asteroids to take us by surprise."
   "COG_71110"	   0  "Looks like they were successful."
   "COG_71111"	   0  "It's not something you typically see in an asteroid."
   "COG_71113"	   0  "Sir, our long range outpost on Delta 3 has picked up an Imperial strike force entering hyperspace."
   "COG_71114"	   0  "Using their last known course and speed, we estimate they will arrive within 3 hours."
   "COG_71115"	   0  "We can't get our evacuation shuttles off the ground with those asteroids pinning us down, and once the primary force arrives we're done for."
   "COG_71116"	   0  "Sensors detect Imperial ground troops landing just outside our shields."
   "COG_71117"	   0  "Send Squads 2 and 5 to Blue Sector. Tell all troops to prepare for ground assault."
   "COG_71118"	   0  "We still have a chance. I'm gonna see if I can 'borrow' a shuttle from our visitors. Then I'll see what I can do about those asteroids."
   "COG_71119"	   0  "I'm going with you, you're gonna--"
   "COG_71120"	   0  "No, Mara, I need you to stay here to coordinate the base defenses."
   "COG_71121"	   0  "I'll signal you when it's clear to begin the evacuation."
   "COG_71122"	   0  "Better make it fast, we have less than 3 hours."
   "COG_71123"	   0  "And Katarn..."
   "COG_71124"	   0  "Yes?"
   "COG_71125"	   0  "Good Luck."
